solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Wisconsin Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: Rules for Selling a Rental</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Wisconsin</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Wisconsin Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Wisconsin Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights sale</li><li>Turn the Wisconsin Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Wisconsin House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Wisconsin statutes set the basic rules between landlords and tenants, including deposits, notices and what happens when a rental is sold.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Landlord may enter only upon advance notice and at reasonable times; advance notice means at least 12 hours unless the tenant consents to shorter. Exceptions: tenant consent, health or safety emergency, tenant absent and entry needed to protect premises. (Wis. Admin. Code ATCP 134.09(2); <a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/code/admin_code/atcp/090/134/09' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord duties: keep portions under its control and service equipment in reasonable repair, make necessary structural repairs, and for residential tenancies comply with local housing code. (Wis. Stat. 704.07(2)(a); <a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/document/statutes/704.07' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>If premises are untenantable or there is a substantial violation materially affecting health or safety, tenant may move out unless landlord promptly repairs; if tenant stays, rent abates, but rent may not be withheld in full. Residential waiver of this section is void. (Wis. Stat. 704.07(1), (4); <a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/document/statutes/704.07' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Wisconsin?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Wisconsin houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash O