itle='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Wisconsin law requires a landlord to give a specific written notice before filing an eviction, and the number of days depends on the reason.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Nonpayment, month-to-month or week-to-week tenant: tenancy ends if landlord gives notice to pay or vacate at least 5 days after notice and tenant fails to pay. (Wis. Stat. 704.17(1p)(a); <a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/document/statutes/704.17' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Other breach/waste: 14-day notice to vacate where the tenant repeats within one year after a prior notice; 14-day notice to vacate also appears for month-to-month tenants who breach. (Wis. Stat. 704.17; <a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/document/statutes/704.17' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Eviction is a small claims action in circuit court; on judgment for restitution the court orders a writ of restitution issued, delivered to the sheriff, who must execute it within 10 days of receipt; a writ is not executed if received by the sheriff more than 30 days after issuance. (Wis. Stat. 799.44(2), 799.45(5)(a); <a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/document/statutes/799.40' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>The sheriff removes the defendant and persons claiming under the defendant using reasonable force. (Wis. Stat. 799.45(2)(a); <a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/document/statutes/799.40' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Wisconsin?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Wisconsin houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/wisconsin-squatters-rights-adverse-possession/'>Wisconsin Squatters Rights and Adverse Possession</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/wisconsin-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/'>Wisconsin Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/wisconsin-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Wisconsin guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-wisconsin/'>We buy houses in Wisconsin</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/document/statutes/704.17' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Wis. Stat. 704.17(1p)(a)</a></li><li><a href='https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/document/statutes/799.40' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Wis. Stat. 799.44(2), 799.45(5)(a)</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Wisconsin Eviction Notice Rules, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Wisconsin\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-wisconsin/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Wisconsin Eviction Notice: Types and Days\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/wisconsin-eviction-notice/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Wisconsin Eviction Notice: Types and Days", "rank_math_description": "Wisconsin eviction notice rules: notice types, required days, which court hears the case and selling a rental. Official sources.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "wisconsin eviction notice"}]